OL,3,AInterest rates held but Bank signals
OL,4,Arise if energy prices stay high
OL,5,
OL,6,FBank of England governor Andrew Bailey
OL,7,Fsaid the longer the volatility in
OL,8,Fenergy prices persists, "the bigger the
OL,9,Fimpact it will have on inflation and
OL,10,Fthe more likely it is we will need to
OL,11,Fraise [the] Bank rate to ensure that
OL,12,Finflation falls back to our 2% target".
